									</figgroup>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry align="center" colname="col4" valign="middle">
								<p>Beeps continuously</p>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<p>The corresponding indicator will appear whenever each ultrasonic sensor detects a person, animal or object in its sensing range. Also, an audible warning will sound.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>When more than two objects are detected at the same time, the closest one will be warned with an audible warning.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>When the distance from the object is more than 60 cm (24 in), it is not displayed on the cluster in case of forward and outer warning.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>The shape of the indicator in the illustration may differ from the actual vehicle.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</conbody>
</concept>